  "keyFeatures": [
    "Plugin-based architecture for extensible memory analysis",
    "Cross-platform support for Windows, Linux, and macOS memory images",
    "Automatic symbol table discovery and generation (Automagic)",
    "Layered memory abstraction supporting LIME, VMware, AVML, crash dumps, and more",
    "JSON-based symbol tables (ISF) compatible with Windows PDB and Linux DWARF",
    "Interactive memory exploration via Volshell",
    "Usable both as a CLI tool and as a Python library",
    "Built-in renderers for text, CSV, JSON, SQLite, and custom output formats"
  ],
